  {
    "hotel_id": "937293",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/grand-swiss-hotel/hotel/penang-my.html",
    "name": "Grand Swiss Hotel",
    "detail": "Very clean, friendly staff, and strategic place where easy to find restaurants, cafe, and street foods. (Penang is foods heaven) Can walk within a few minutes to the street art and museum. Also can take bus in Jalan Penang (rapid & hop on hop off bus) which is 5 mins from hotel. Oh.. You also can buy ticket for hop on hop off bus in the hotel's counter. MYR 19 for Malaysian adults. (but i prefer uber haha). This hotel is also safe and not really near the traffic. Could not hear any noise from the room though. They also provide tea and coffee at 1.00 - 6.00 pm free for customers even if you book a room that is not include the breakfast. But, they only provide one socket and not enough to charge phones, laptop, etc. The room also quite small but it is just okay if you're just find a room to sleep at night. In conclusion, this hotel is worth what i paid. I will definitely recommend this hotel for my family & friends. Thank you. ",
